# Ghost Vacuum: "{T}: Exile target card from a graveyard." and "{6}, {T}, Sacrifice Ghost Vacuum: Put each creature
# card exiled with Ghost Vacuum onto the battlefield under your control with a flying counter on it. Each of them is a
# 1/1 Spirit in addition to its other types. Activate only as a sorcery."
#
# Turn 1: Bot1 casts Ghost Vacuum. Turn 2: Bot2 casts Dark Confidant. Turn 3: Bot1 Bolts it and exiles it with the Vacuum.
# Turn 5: Bot1 spends six mana and the Vacuum: Bot2's Dark Confidant enters under Bot1's control with a flying counter, a
# 1/1 Human Wizard Spirit (the counter gives flying, CR 122.1b; the 2/1 is set to 1/1, CR 613.4b).

